/* Retail 25 -- sanitised sample database: schema and rows in one file.

   Generated 2026-10-17 from a restored copy of a working database, after running
   docs/runbooks/sanitise-database.sql over that copy.

   No real person is in this file. Staff and customer names, e-mail addresses, phone
   numbers and postal addresses are replaced; every password hash is the same published
   placeholder; till PINs, issued tokens, OAuth grants, data-protection keys, the audit
   log, carts in flight and the shop logo are removed outright.

   Products, prices, stock levels, RFID tags, sales, ledger entries, tax configuration,
   permissions and roles are kept exactly as they were. That is the part worth having.

   Run it against an EMPTY database. See docs/sample-data/README.md. */

SET NOCOUNT ON;
GO

